<title>NETHERLANDS: Gist-Brocades 1996 net profit rises.</title>
<headline>Gist-Brocades 1996 net profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>DELFT, Netherlands 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Full year 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     3.97 vs   3.74</p>
<p>    Net profit			   158.5  vs 144.1</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  1.60 vs   1.50</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  2.02 vs   1.84</p>
<p>    Operating profit		   196.5  vs 178.7</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts had expected pharmaceuticals and food ingredients producer Gist-Brocades NV to report a net profit of between 154 million and 160 million guilders.</p>
<p>    Interest charges		     6.4  vs   2.6</p>
<p>    Tax				     30.9  vs  29.7</p>
<p>    Third party interests		0.7  vs   2.3</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
